{
  "schema": "quick-detail/hatch-catalogue-1",
  "about": "Catalogue of the hatch patterns shown in the reference images in this folder. Each entry has a name as printed on the sheet and a rough description. 'basis' says how the description was made: 'seen' means the pattern is clear enough in the image to describe its look; 'from name' means the image is too small to read the pattern, so the description is inferred from the name and should be checked against the CAD library before use. Names are copied from the sheets and may contain typos. The catalogue describes; it does not decide which hatches the app uses (see docs/hatch-reference.md). Sheet 02 was removed at the owner's request. Its entries are notes written from it for study, not copies, and the image is not kept in the repo.",
